          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dî dia tshijila",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30.6:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Tangila Yeshaya 13.1.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " bua nyama ya ku luseke lua Sude.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuenu, ba mu Siona badi bashikame mu Yelushalema, kanuena nudila kabidi. Yeye neanuleshe dinanga diandi bulelela hunvueye muadi wenu; mu diba didiye unvua neitabe kunudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nansha biakuha Mukelenge bia kudia bidi bikeha mu tshikondo tshibi, ne mai adi akeha mu tshikondo tshia makenga. Muyishi webe kena usokoma kabidi, mesu ebe neamone Muyishi webe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hawakeba kusesuka ku tshianza tshia balume, anyi ku tshianza tshia bakashi, matshu ebe neunvue dî difume ku nyima kuebe, diamba ne, Nshila kayeu, endelamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nenunyange tshiamu tshia argent tshinudi balamike ku mpingu yebe misonga, ne tshiamu tshia or tshinudi balamike ku mpingu yebe mifudibue; nenubimashe bu tshilulu tshinyanguke ne bukoya; nenubambile ne, Umukai kutudi!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye neakutumine nvula bua maminu ebe audi ukuna mu buloba, ne bidia bia ku matete adi buloba budiundisha nebikale ne manyi, nebikale bia bungi. Mu dituku adi bimuna biebe nebidie mashinde mu madimi manene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngombe ne nyama ya mpunda idi ibila buloba mu budimi buebe neyidie bia kudia bimpe bisangisha ne luehu, bia kudia mene bidibo bahehula ne tshikasu tshia mpau ne tshihehudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tusulu tua mai ne misulu mikuabo nebikale ha mutu ha mukuna mule wonso ne ha mutu ha mukuna muihi wonso, mu dituku dia kushiha kunene, huhuka bibumba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bukuabo kabidi, munya udi ufuma ku ngondo newikale bu munya udi ufuma ku diba, ne munya wa ku diba neuvudishibue misangu muanda mutekete, newikale bu munya wa matuku muanda mutekete, mu dituku didi Yehowa ujingila mputa ya bantu bandi, ne udi ukamisha mputa yakatahibuabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuenu nenuikale ne musambu bu musambu udibo bimba ku butuku hadiabo bidia bia disanka dia tshijila; nenuikale ne disanka dia mutshima, bu disanka dia muntu udi wenda wela lushiba hayeye ku mukuna wa Yehowa, kudi Dibue dia Isalele mene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa neunvuishe bantu dî diandi dia butumbi, neamueneshe dihueka dia diboko diandi hanshi mu kuvulangana kua tshiji, mu ludimi lua kahia kadi kashidisha, mu kuhumuka kua nvula, mu tshihuhu ne mu mabue a nvula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bua dî dia Yehowa Muena Ashû neikale ne buowa bukole; neamukume ne tshibonge tshiandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukumu wonso wa mulangala wa mulau udi Yehowa umukuma nʼau newikale ne tshiona tshia makasa ne nzenze; nealue kudibo ne diboko diela mulu, utshintshila bua kuluangana nʼabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua bakumana kulongolola tshioshelu tshia kuoshelahu bitalu; e, bakutshilongoluela mukelenge; bakutshivuisha tshile ne tshinene; bakutentekashaku makala ne nkunyi ya bungi; muhuya wa Yehowa, udi bu musulu wa soufre, udi ubitemesha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
